WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.919
When I was a kid, I thought Zootopia was this perfect place where everyone got along and

00:00:09.919 --> 00:00:16.800
anyone could be anything. Turns out, real life's a little bit more complicated than a

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:26.879
slogan on a bumper sticker. Real life is messy. We all have limitations. We all make mistakes,

00:00:26.879 --> 00:00:32.079
which means, hey, glass half full, we all have a lot in common. And the more we try to

00:00:32.079 --> 00:00:39.039
understand one another, the more exceptional each of us will be. But we have to try.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:48.159
So no matter what type of animal you are, from the biggest elephant to our first fox,

00:00:48.639 --> 00:01:01.839
I implore you, try. Try to make the world a better place. Look inside yourself and recognize

00:01:01.839 --> 00:01:11.679
that change starts with you. It starts with me. It starts with all of us.
